    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present an attractive three bedroom detached dormer bungalow located in a mature development just a short stroll from Clane village and all its excellent amenities and services. This lovely family home boasts a spacious, efficient layout, bright airy rooms, a host of welcoming features and enjoys a most convenient, private location. \nNo.19 enjoys a generous plot in which you could relax on long summer days with lots of room for an avid gardener or a growing family to enjoy. Ottomy is a delightful, well maintained development just a few minutes' walk from Clane village and its array of excellent amenities including shops, schools (primary & secondary), church, cafes, pubs, restaurants, leisure centre and a wide range of sporting and recreational facilities. Commuting to Dublin city and its surrounding areas couldn't be easier via a frequent bus service, rail links from nearby Sallins and Maynooth combined with convenience to the M4 and M7 motorways. \nViewing of this lovely home is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.8m x 1.1m\nWith vinyl flooring, telephone point, cloakroom.\n\nLounge - 4.3m x 3.6m\nWith feature fireplace, wooden flooring, tv point.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.6m x 3.4m\nWith fitted kitchen, vinyl flooring, tiled splashback, electric cooker, fridge/freezer, extractor.\n\nUtility Room - 2.0m x 1.7m\nWith fitted storage units, provision for usual appliances, vinyl flooring, rear door access.\n\nW.C. - 1.7m x 1.4m\nWith wc, whb, vinyl flooring, tiled splashback.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m x 2.6m\nWith laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 2.5m\nTo front with carpet.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 3.4m\nTo back with fitted wardrobes, carpet.\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 2.0m\nWith bath, Triton electric shower over the bath, wc, whb, vinyl flooring, tiled splashback, shower screen, mirror, shaving light, extractor.\n\nLanding - 2.1m x 2.0m\nWith carpet, airing cupboard, attic hatch.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Constructed C. 2007</li><li>Floor area 130 sq m approx</li><li>Natural gas central heating</li><li>Double glazed windows</li><li>6 panel internal doors</li><li>Wired for alarm</li><li>Blinds, lightfittings</li><li>Off street parking, Side gate</li><li>Outside tap, Steel garden shed</li><li>Low maintenance render.</ul>"
      },
